@ Start

- Melusina
  The festival banners are down. Someone else already packed their cart.
  The road is kind like that - it always lets you be just a little too late.

- Melusina
  The perch is empty again. I know a small absence can fill a whole room.

      $ Voice {&/Game/Melodia/Characters/Melusina/Audio/mel_perch_01.mel_perch_01} 0.9

- Melusina
  Sir flew off for snacks again. He does that. He always comes back.

* Follow the quiet chirp. | melodia_met_melodious = on | -> Reunion
* Wait and listen. | -> Listening

<@> Reunion

? if: {melodia_met_melodious} == on

  - Melusina
    The quiet petal answers. I can follow it without pretending the room is full.

? else:

  - Melusina
    I will listen first. The answer can come when the echo has made room for it.

? endif

-> Departure

<@> Listening

- Melusina
  I will listen first. The answer can come when the echo has made room for it.

-> Departure

<@> Departure

- Melusina
  I'll keep the seat warm. Arriving late isn't the same as being unwanted.

- Melusina
  The dream is restless. Stay close, and sing when I sing.

      $ Voice {&/Game/Melodia/Characters/Melusina/Audio/mel_battle_entry.mel_battle_entry} 0.9

$ %melodia_morning_sir.BeginWindowDeparture
$ End
